<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37544" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομόρ-γνῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομόρξω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wipe off from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δ᾽ ὄμορξον στόματος πέλανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					219
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>wipe off from, purge away a pollution,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νασμοῖσι</span> with water, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				653
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα ἐξομόρξασθαι πέπλοις</span>
			<i>wipe off</i> blood <i>on your</i> garments, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HF</u>
				1399
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				502
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομόρξασθαί τινι μωρίαν</span>
			<i>wipe off one's</i> folly <i>on</i> another, i.e. give him
			part of it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				344
			</span></i>, parodied by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				843
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομάττομαι</span>
			, <i>stamp</i> or <i>imprint upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ ἑκάστη ἡ πρᾶξις αὐτοῦ ἐξωμόρξατο
					εἰς τὴν ψυχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					525a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				775d
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Chaerem.
				14.15
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
